  // Contact AO: paired depth taps cancel the ground plane's slope, so only real creases (feet,
  // prop bases, cliff toes) darken. The pair is summed in inverse depth (1/z runs straight across
  // any plane on screen, z itself curves) and turned back into metres: in z the far floor's own
  // curve crossed the threshold and darkened a band of the ground, its edge zigzagging with the
  // vertex snap (the Sketchbook's "line across the middle", owner report 2026-10-23).
